        "1.20.6-2.3.0":"- Updated to Minecraft 1.20.6\r\n- Switched to NeoForge, version 20.6.71-beta\r\n- Error reporting for multiblocks structures now happens while sneaking\r\n- Bumped version to 2.3.0"
		,
        "1.20.6-2.3.1":"- Fix multiblock parts being displayed with a broken texture when placed near another multiblock part\r\n- Fix buckets not rendering the fluid colour\r\n- Bumped version to 2.3.1"
		,
        "1.20.6-2.3.2":"- Added back CC:Tweaked support\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked version to 1.111.0\r\n- Use the fallback service if there is no implementation of a mod-dep service while the dep is present. Fix ER #152\r\n- Added Pair codec support to ModCodecs\r\n- Bumped version to 2.3.2"
    },
    "1.21":{
        "1.21-2.4.0":"- Updated Minecraft to version 1.21\r\n- New, simplified, block variant model builders\r\n- New logo!\r\n- Updated CC-Tweaked to version 1.111.0\r\n- Updated JEI to version 19.0.0.9\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.0.21-beta\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.0"
		,
		"1.21-2.4.1":"- NeoForge only register capabilities for BucketItem so let's register them ourself. Closes ER #160\r\n- Bumped version 2.4.1"
    },
    "1.21.1":{
		"1.21.1-2.4.2":"- Updated Minecraft to version 1.21.1\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.1.22\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.113.0\r\n- Updated JEI to version 19.9.0.122\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.2"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.3":"- Multiblock: Request render updates only on the logical client side\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.3"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.8":"- Switched Item/FluidStack serialization to the Item/FluidStack optional codec. Closes ER 164\r\n- Fix stack holders not correctly saving content\r\n- Added missing equals/hashCode methods to AbstractStackListComponent\r\n- Added prefix-less serialize() overload to IStackAdapter (never trust again 3rd party mappings)\r\n- Added codecs to the Colour class\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.8"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.9":"- Fixed a crash with sodium 0.0.6 beta. WorldHelper#markBlockRangeForRenderUpdate now requires a Level: this is a breaking change\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.9"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.11":"- Reset shader colour after paint a solid rect / triangle. Closes ER #172\r\n- Added back Patchouli support\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.21-87\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.11"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.13":"- (Neo)Forge has an issue where it provides incorrect, empty ModelData when fall damage particles are requested for ModelData-aware blocks (see https://github.com/neoforged/NeoForge/issues/1629). To address this, a fallback ModelData option has been added, which will be used in cases where the requested ModelData returns empty.\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.13"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.14":"- Allows empty FluidStacks in a FluidTankComponent. Closes ER #183\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.14"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.16":"- Make sure that ModelData updates happens on the main client thread\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.16"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.17":"- Avoid adding data components when creating an ItemStackRecipeIngredient from an Item(Like). Closes ER #198\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.17"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.18":"- Added compatibility with Create 6.0.6\r\n- Updated JEI to version 19.21.0.247\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.21-88\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.115.1\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.1.152\r\n- Updated gradle to version 8.10\r\n- Updated NeoGradle to version 7.0.183\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.18"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.20":"- GUI: fixed problems for tooltips on retina displays Macs\r\n- GUI: the debug frame feature can now be used outside a dev-env\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.20"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.21":"- Stop multiblocks from keeping chunks loaded more then necessary\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.21"
	},		
    "1.21.4":{
		"1.21.4-2.4.15":"- BETA VERSION\r\n- Updated Minecraft to version 1.21.4\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.4.51-beta\r\n- Bumped version to 1.21.4-2.4.15"
		,
		"1.21.4-2.4.16":"- Patched reload listeners registration after NeoForge changes caused issues.\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.4.97-beta\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.16"
    },		
