        "1.19-2.0.46":"- Updated Minecraft to version 1.19\r\n- World-gen is not defined by json files, yeah....\r\n- Updated Forge to version 41.0.17\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.18\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.46"
